    "summary": "Customer reports a wrong item on K-6601 (Spice Route): ordered paneer makhani ($15.00), received chicken makhani. Nobody ate it, and no one was harmed. The order was placed at 18:58 local, inside the window of open incident INC-311 (recalled curry sauce batch, orders placed 17:00-19:00). No compensation was issued by support. The incident team should handle compensation for this order."
