  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "**About the recall:** All our records say is that the supplier recalled a sauce batch used in Spice Route's curries. They don't list which dishes were affected, so I can't tell you which curries are safe. To be safe, please don't eat any curry from order K-6601. The specialist following up on ESC-700 can give you more detail.\n\n**About a refund for K-6601:** I know you'd like the money back on your card. The incident team is handling compensation for every order the recall affected, and it's their decision. I can't promise what they'll offer, but I added your wrong-item problem and your preference for a card refund to the case. They'll contact you within 24 hours.\n\n**Order K-6602 (missing garlic naan):** This order was placed at 7:02 PM, after the time the incident covers, so I can fix this one myself now. You were charged $4.00 for the missing naan. You can choose one:\n\n- **$4.00 refunded** to your Visa ending 4242, or\n- **$4.80 in Forkful account credit** (the item's price plus 20%)\n\nWhich would you like? While you decide, what was the third problem?"
