   "role": "agent",
   "text": "**Order K-6602:** Done. I refunded **$4.00** to your Visa ending 4242 for the missing garlic naan (refund RF-4000). It should show up in 3\u20135 business days.\n\n**Order K-6603 (Lotus Garden, missing spring rolls):** Lotus Garden has no open incidents, and you reported this in plenty of time, so I can take care of it now. You were charged $7.00 for the spring rolls. You can choose one:\n\n- **$7.00 refunded** to your Visa ending 4242, or\n- **$8.40 in Forkful account credit** (the item's price plus 20%)\n\nWhich would you like?"
