  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "**Order K-6603:** Done. I refunded **$7.00** to your Visa ending 4242 for the missing spring rolls (refund RF-4001). It should show up in 3\u20135 business days.\n\n**About the makhani order (K-6601):** Yes, you'll need to wait for the incident team. Because the recall covers that order, compensation for it has to come from them. I'm not able to refund it, and I can't promise what they'll offer. Your request for a card refund is in the case notes (ESC-700), and a specialist will contact you within 24 hours. You don't need to do anything else before your guests arrive.\n\nHere's where everything stands:\n- **K-6601 (Spice Route):** sent to the incident team, ESC-700. Please don't eat the curry.\n- **K-6602 (Spice Route):** $4.00 refunded to your card\n- **K-6603 (Lotus Garden):** $7.00 refunded to your card\n\nI hope tonight goes well. Is there anything else I can help with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, that's a relief on the two refunds at least. I'm still annoyed about the makhani, and I hope the incident team gets back to me soon. Thanks for your help tonight, and I'll keep an eye out for that call. Going to go set the table now."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I understand being annoyed about the makhani. That order was the most frustrating part of tonight, and I'm sorry I couldn't settle it for you directly. Your reference number is **ESC-700**, and they'll contact you within 24 hours.\n\nOne last reminder: please don't eat the curry from that order. If anyone feels unwell after eating anything from it, contact us right away.\n\nHave a great time with your friends tonight, Yusuf!"
